<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69970" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεᾰρο-ποιέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make new, refresh,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.702c
			</span></i>:—in 
				Med.
			, <i>freshen up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τῆς ὕλης σύστασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herm.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Medic.,
				<i>freshen</i> the edges of an ulcer by removing granulations,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. ἕλκος, κοιλώματα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.23.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap.eund.<i><span class="en">
				8.24.48
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>renew, repeat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.41
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				15.2
			</span></i> (
				Act.
			).</div>
